WEBVTT

00:13.797 --> 00:31.867
Another

00:31.927 --> 00:34.449
mile on a lonely road

00:37.951 --> 00:40.592
Just trying to get back to you

00:45.357 --> 00:51.758
I'm carrying this heavy load They're telling me

00:51.918 --> 00:54.319
what I have to do

00:57.960 --> 01:01.421
The lights are bright, the stage is cold They're

01:01.481 --> 01:06.102
trying to fit me in their mold I see your face

01:06.182 --> 01:07.962
across the black

01:11.357 --> 01:16.938
I know that we can find our way back We're worlds

01:17.018 --> 01:21.679
apart But our hearts beat the same

01:25.360 --> 01:31.121
I can hear you call my name Through the distance

01:31.681 --> 01:36.122
Through the static and the dark We're finding

01:36.202 --> 01:43.127
our way back to the start Even when we're worlds

01:43.147 --> 01:43.487
apart

01:57.554 --> 02:01.016
They want the loudest, they want the engine A

02:01.096 --> 02:03.858
different version for a different show But

02:04.238 --> 02:06.759
we're the ones who'll be here in the end

02:11.095 --> 02:16.936
We've got a fire they'll never know We're worlds

02:17.056 --> 02:21.658
apart But our hearts beat the same

02:25.379 --> 02:31.160
I can hear you call my name Through the distance

02:31.680 --> 02:36.261
Through the static and the dark We're finding a

02:36.321 --> 02:43.154
way back to the start Even when we're worlds

02:43.374 --> 02:48.037
apart

02:48.877 --> 02:49.117
And

02:55.461 --> 03:03.985
when the mountains fall And when the oceans rise

03:05.286 --> 03:13.111
I'll find you We're

03:13.191 --> 03:17.994
worlds apart, but our hearts beat the same I

03:22.138 --> 03:27.806
can hear you call my name Through the distance,

03:28.326 --> 03:32.809
through the static and the dark We're finding

03:32.889 --> 03:40.174
our way back to the start Even when we're worlds

03:40.194 --> 03:44.477
apart

03:45.638 --> 03:47.700
Worlds apart

